# Set only the selected flow's inputs. Keep real credentials in an untracked .env.
# Copy keygen's output into your untracked .env. It contains throwaway private keys.
# Ed25519 is a 64-byte keypair as hex. secp256* keys are 32-byte secrets as hex.
# SWIG_ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY=
# SWIG_SECP256K1_PRIVATE_KEY=
# SWIG_SECP256R1_PRIVATE_KEY=
